          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只能保存受支持的远程漫画供离线阅读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the downloaded copies of the current visible comics will be removed from this device. The remote server, saved folder, and reading progress stay intact.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只會從此裝置移除目前顯示中漫畫的下載副本。遠端伺服器、已儲存的資料夾與閱讀進度不受影響。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在表示中のコミックのダウンロード済みコピーだけを、このデバイスから削除します。リモートサーバー、保存済みフォルダ、読書の進捗は保持されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会从此设备移除当前显示漫画的已下载副本。远程服务器、已保存文件夹和阅读进度不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the downloaded copy of the current visible comic will be removed from this device. The remote server, saved folder, and reading progress stay intact.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
